# Agentic Skills

Repo-local skills live in `.agents/skills/` (Cursor auto-discovers).
Holus owns `post` and the Company OS skill set: `company-brand-desk`,
`company-content-desk`, `company-marketing-desk`, `company-sales-desk`,
`company-evolve`, and `company-supervisor`. Their discovery and evaluation
contracts are `agentic/manifest.yaml` and `agentic/evals.yaml`.

Fleet platform skills remain reusable mechanisms. They must not replace the
Holus-owned safety, review, or evaluation contracts for these domain skills.
